-33.57899 -2.7 Td
(There are times when you want your code to make a decision. For example,\ if you are )Tj
T*
(approximating a differential equation, and the rate of change is discont\inuous, you may want to )Tj
T*
(change the rate depending on what time step you are on. )Tj
0 -2.55714 TD
(Here we will define an executable file that contains an if statement. Th\e file is called by Matlab, )Tj
0 -1.2 TD
(and it constructs a second derivative finite difference matrix with boun\dary conditions. There is a )Tj
T*
(variable in the file called )Tj
/T1_3 1 Tf
(decision)Tj
/T1_0 1 Tf
(. If this variable is less than 3, the file will find and plot the )Tj
T*
(eigen values of the matrix, if it is greater than 3 the eigen values of \the inverse of the matrix are )Tj
T*
(found and plotted, otherwise, the system is inverted to find an approxim\ation to y'=sin\(x\) )Tj
T*
(according to the specified boundary conditions. )Tj
