(There are times when you want certain parts of your program to be execut\ed only in limited )Tj
T*
(circumstances. The way to do that is to put the code within an "if" stat\ement. The most basic )Tj
T*
(structure for an "if" statement is the following: )Tj
/T1_4 1 Tf
0 -2.56195 TD
(if  )Tj
/T1_5 1 Tf
(\(condition statement\))Tj
/T1_4 1 Tf
0 -1.2 TD
(    \(matlab commands\))Tj
T*
(end)Tj
/T1_0 1 Tf
0 -2.55232 TD
(More complicated structures are also possible including combinations lik\e the following: )Tj
/T1_4 1 Tf
0 -2.56197 TD
(if  )Tj
/T1_5 1 Tf
(\(condition statement\))Tj
/T1_4 1 Tf
0 -1.2 TD
(    \(matlab commands\))Tj
T*
(elseif  )Tj
/T1_5 1 Tf
(\(condition statement\))Tj
/T1_4 1 Tf
T*
(    \(matlab commands\))Tj
T*
(elseif )Tj
/T1_5 1 Tf
(\(condition statement\))Tj
/T1_4 1 Tf
T*
(    \(matlab commands\))Tj
T*
(.)Tj
0 -1.2 TD
(.)Tj
0 -1.2 TD
(.)Tj
T*
(else)Tj
T*
(    \(matlab commands\))Tj
T*
(end)Tj
